The "trace of Sylen" he speaks of can be found on Phinigel Autropos in Kedge Keep (/loc?). A Blue Crystal Staff is what you need. It's one of Phinigel's rare drops so you're in for a "fun" camp. He can be taken out easily by two or three organized groups. He has a number of magic immune guardians surrounding him so you may want a monk to do the pulling.

You say, 'What about Demunir Scry?'

