You receive a Note from Arantir (identifies as "What is lost must be found"). It reads:

 Greetings Sir Gnome, I hope this letter reaches you in good health.

The gnome Arantir is referring to is Kandin Firepot by the docks in Butcherblock, at -1491, +2843.

